<title>USA: Trico Marine stake cut by Dawson group.</title>
<headline>Trico Marine stake cut by Dawson group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Dawson-Samberg Capital Management Inc said it cut its stake in Trico Marine Services Inc to 279,100 common shares or 4.1 percent from 6.25 perviously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 121,800 common shares sold between Oct 17 and Oct 24 at prices ranging from $32.7946 to $37.6002 per share.</p>
<p>Dawson-Samberg is a Southport, Conn., investment advisor.</p>
